WEBVTT

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.480
We did it! We're going to the finals!

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.940
Hey! Rei!

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.940
Congratulations.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.690
I was watching intently...
The reborn Sunny Peace!

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.690
Thanks.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.350
It's Moon Tempest's turn next!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:24.480
Yeah.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.520
I feel heavy...

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:33.980
Are you okay?

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.560
I'm fine.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.690
Mana, are you okay?

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:42.850
It's nothing.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:46.810
This is happening because Sakura
stopped singing with Mana's voice.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.730
Makino...

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:54.150
Sakura's been taking action solely
based on the guidance of her heartbeat.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.650
Her heart used to be Mana's.

00:00:56.650 --> 00:01:00.810
Because the heart lived on,
Mana has been able to exist like this.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.900
Makino, that's enough.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:08.350
But now, Sakura is singing with
her own voice, with her own will.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:12.850
Mana's heart is rapidly
turning into Sakura's heart.

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:17.560
Then, if Sakura continues to sing
with her own voice...

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:22.440
I'm going to let Sakura know!

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.310
Huh?

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:26.230
Mr. Makino...

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.940
I'm glad...

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.810
You're still the Makino I know.

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:32.440
But why?

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:38.560
Sakura and Kotono have finally found
their purpose and are moving forward.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.230
Everyone is trying to follow them, too.

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:46.190
Makino wouldn't do anything
to hinder them, never!

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:48.600
But you're going to disappear, Mana!

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.850
If you don't do anything,
you're going to die!

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.940
I'm already dead.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.980
You're not going to say anything to Kotono?

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:02.940
I don't want to keep quiet like this.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:06.270
Mana, isn't it about time
you talk to Kotono?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.230
What?

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.940
No, I think you should.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:11.690
It's for Kotono's sake.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.980
There may not be much time left.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.690
Okay... You're right.

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.150
I have to finish... my last assignment.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.520
I know it's hard to believe this
coming out of the blue...

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.940
But it's true. Please believe it.

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:35.400
If it's true... Is my sister here right now?

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.770
She's not here right now.

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:41.850
She said she'd see you
only if you wanted to.

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.190
I see.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.150
Do you believe us?

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:48.850
If it were the usual me,
I think I'd never believe it.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:53.600
But I don't think you'd go out of your way
to tell me a lie during this crucial time.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.940
Will you see her?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:55.820
I won't.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:56.810
What?

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:58.060
But why?

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:02.400
I can't right now. I'd rather see her
after the Grand Prix.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.560
That's going to be too late!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:06.600
Too late?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.980
I meant... That seems too late
when you can see her right away.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.730
Mana's finally made up her mind to see you.

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:15.520
Will you see her?

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:20.940
I've always chased after my sister's back.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:26.230
In order to fulfill the dream
she couldn't achieve.

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:30.770
When I entrusted my sister's song
to Sakura, I started to feel lost.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:33.900
What's my reason for
performing from here on out?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.560
But...

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.690
I think I'm close to figuring it out!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:42.150
How I'm supposed to proceed
as Kotono of Moon Tempest!

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:46.600
If I find out what my sister
thinks of all this...

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.560
You would lose that?

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:51.400
Regardless of whether she's
affirmative or negative,

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.940
I have a feeling it would end something.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.730
Kotono?

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.310
Sakura...?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.810
I see. You knew about my sister, too.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:20.940
Yeah, I found out when I was told
my heart belonged to Miss Mana.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.770
So Sakura, can you...

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:24.940
Can you see her?

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.020
No, I can't see her.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:33.270
But I thought I heard Miss Mana's
voice through this heart.

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:38.150
She told me to put in my all
and sing the song only I can sing.

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:42.600
After hearing Miss Mana's words,
I felt that I needed to change.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:47.730
That I needed to take action based on my own
will, not just relying on my heart's guidance.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:52.600
I was able to get this far
because my sister disappeared.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.400
Miss Mana was saying the same thing.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.980
What?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:05:02.100
She said if she were to talk to you now,
your tense focus would snap.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.730
She said that...?

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.600
But even with that, Miss Mana said
she wanted to see you, right?

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.310
There must be a reason for it.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:16.980
Regardless, she's your sister! She must
have a lot she wants to talk to you about.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:19.480
Is that not the case for you, Kotono?

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:20.850
I...

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.230
By a curious coincidence, you'll be facing
an idol of Hoshimi Productions again,

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:37.310
and among them Miss Mana Nagase's
biological sister, Miss Kotono,

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.690
for this upcoming semi-final battle.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:44.440
How does LizNoir feel about
this strange quirk of fate?

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:49.980
In that sense, I think we will be able to
achieve a performance that won't disappoint.

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:52.480
Nevertheless, there aren't any special feelings.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:55.770
No matter who we're up against,
we give it our all on stage

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.940
and aim for victory.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.460
Reserved for Moon Tempest

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.480
I know, right?

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.480
Where's Kotono?

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.900
She said she had a matter to tend to...

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.650
A matter?

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:10.150
You're asking me what kind of
idol Mana Nagase was?

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:11.560
Yes.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.900
You're really asking me that as her sister?

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:17.980
My sister was never home
once she became an idol,

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.440
so I don't know anything.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.560
You weren't interested in idols?

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:25.520
If I had to say anything...
I'd say I hated them.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:28.270
But you are one now.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.980
Are you doing this for Mana?

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.060
At first, I was.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:36.560
I'm sure this sounds irritating
to you, Miss Rio.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.310
My initial purpose was money.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.900
What?

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.730
I wanted to take care of my mother.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:45.230
I didn't want to give up on the family business.

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:48.900
To do that, becoming an idol was the option
that seemed the most doable to me.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.400
I see...

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:54.770
But with that kind of purpose,
although my technique improved,

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:57.150
I still wasn't able to move people's hearts.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:07:00.980
Aoi was the one who taught me
about what I lacked.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:05.850
She was discovered by Mr. Saegusa,
who was our manager back then.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.810
Mr. Saegusa...?

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:11.560
I wanted to make our debut as soon as possible,
to become popular as soon as possible...

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:15.730
Aoi said it felt heavy watching me
dance with those feelings.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:20.940
She had the right to say that because her
dancing was light, free, and felt good.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:26.400
Then with Mr. Saegusa as our producer,
we formed LizNoir.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.770
With a favorable start, busy days followed.

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:36.100
But at one point, Mr. Saegusa quit
the agency and had to leave us.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:40.190
After a while, he established
Hoshimi Productions

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:43.150
and met Mana Nagase.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.150
Of course I minded that.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:50.060
But Mana Nagase never showed
any interest in us.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.480
It got on my nerves.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.400
I felt like I was being ignored.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.850
One time...

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:04.060
It's annoying to admit, but I was
moved listening to her sing.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:06.400
A performance that energized me.

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:09.480
It made my feelings brighter and made me smile.

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.100
I wanted to watch her forever.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:16.900
It was a performance that made me
realize that I actually liked her.

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:22.020
Watching her perform, I realized
this is the power of idols.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.690
Why people come to like idols and support them.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.310
I felt I understood that for the first time.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:32.310
Mana Nagase is that kind of entity for me.

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:34.730
That's why I want to win.

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:37.150
If Mana Nagase is a true idol,

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:42.230
by surpassing her, I'll be able
to recognize myself as an idol.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:44.440
But my sister...

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.560
Yes...

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:49.480
That's why I'm going to win the competition
where I was supposed to face her.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:53.350
I'll see the sight one of us
should've seen three years ago.

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.600
And then I'll ask myself...

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:58.060
...whether I've surpassed
Mana Nagase or not.

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:03.600
If I've become an idol who can move
everyone's hearts and energize them.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.770
We are the same, after all.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.900
You've always been chasing after my sister.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.940
What I said at the press
conference is half true.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:16.350
I have no interest in the fact that
you're Mana Nagase's sister.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:18.650
But half of it is a lie.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:22.270
I'm probably fixated on Mana Nagase
more than anyone else.

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:23.940
What?

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:27.270
Let's bring our genuine feelings
to the stage on battle day.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:30.980
Song against song, let's compete
with all our strength.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:32.270
Yes.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:35.810
Miss Rio!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:40.480
I'm sure my sister is watching!

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:44.690
She's watching me and you, too, Miss Rio!

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.520
I have a feeling she is...

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.690
I'll believe that, for now.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.810
<i>Idoly Pride</i> .

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:09.060
Sorry...

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.650
Don't apologize.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:12.460
No!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.810
If this were the case...

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:14.850
Don't say it!

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.850
I wish I never had a sister!

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.900
I'm sorry.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.900
Big Sister...

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.830
"Rio Kanzaki of LizNoir...
I feel a great energy from her.
Wow, Mr. Saegusa discovered
quite a talent... Jeez."

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:58.190
She rejected me.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:02.100
Being told in the face like that is rough.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.400
But I did work hard writing the lyrics for her.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:09.650
I really want to sing this song
for the finals performance.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:12.350
Tomorrow is Kotono's birthday.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:18.190
Even if she doesn't come see me,
she's still my only dearest sister.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.690
I love you, Kotono.

