00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.370
Birthday

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.900
Big Sister...

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:39.980
Kotono?

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:45.690
What do you think an idol is?

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.100
You're asking a complicated question.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.190
What did my sister say?

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:53.150
Don't know... I've never asked.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.980
Even though you worked with her?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.850
Why don't you ask her yourself?

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:01.520
Is it not an illusion only you and Mei can see?

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.690
That's what I thought in the beginning, too.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.100
But it's not.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.980
Why did she appear as a ghost?

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:12.810
She says she wants to stand on
the finals stage, but that's a joke.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:15.690
I bet she was worried about you, Kotono.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:17.170
I don't think so.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:17.900
Huh?

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:21.810
If that were the case, wouldn't it
make more sense if she appeared to me?

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:22.730
True.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:29.020
Since this is my sister, I'm sure it's not
for herself, but for somebody else.

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:30.520
Somebody else?

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:33.560
I asked her this a long time ago.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.690
"Is there somebody you like?"

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:37.810
There is!

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.480
What kind of person is he?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:43.230
He doesn't stand out.
He's unreliable and a bit dull.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:46.100
Everything about him is so ordinary!

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:51.980
But he's always willing to help those
in need and to scold the bad people.

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.810
He's that ordinary!

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.350
It made sense to me.

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:00.020
Would you like someone that ordinary?

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.560
I can understand why my sister was befuddled.

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:16.230
Kotono...?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.730
I'm thinking of talking to my sister.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.100
She can't converse with her
without us interpreting.

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.400
She said she's fine by herself.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:41.980
Big Sister, I have a lot to ask
and apologize to you about.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.350
About the last night...

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:50.060
Your thoughts around it and how you felt
when you wrote that diary entry...

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:53.270
But I've decided to not ask you anything.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:58.190
Because those are the things I have
to find closure for by myself.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:07.400
I never understood what idols were or
why you worked so frantically to be one.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.020
But now I understand.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:14.850
Going on stage, delivering songs
to everyone, and seeing their joy...

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:18.400
What a wonderful thing that is.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:19.980
That's why...

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:23.560
That's why...

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.770
I won't chase after you anymore.

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:31.310
I don't want to stand on stage
in lieu of you, either!

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:37.350
Like you, Big Sister, I want
to love idols even more

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:41.060
and bring joy to far more people.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.940
I want to discover the idol I want
to be for myself and move forward.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:52.980
Does this make you happy?
Or maybe you're sad...

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:58.560
But... You're listening to me, right?
You're watching me...

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.520
Big Sister...

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.850
Sounds good to me.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:21.940
The A Block semi-final battle

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:26.190
between Moon Tempest and
LizNoir will begin momentarily.

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:31.480
Watch LizNoir's performance very carefully.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.440
They'll definitely win, right?

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:35.600
I wouldn't be so sure about that.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.020
What?!

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:45.650
I'm looking forward to the finals performance.

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:48.940
I have no desire to be friendly
with an opponent.

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:51.980
How could you be like that?

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:53.940
Are you mocking us?

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:58.190
I was just hoping to make it a fun performance.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:00.060
But... okay.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:04.190
Then, if I win the finals,
come shake my hand first.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.190
What?

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:09.230
Normally, I don't care about winning or losing.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.730
But that just now got on my nerves.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:14.440
I'm wanting to win for the first time.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:18.850
There have been many idols
who declared that they'd defeat me.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.600
But I've never lost to anyone yet.

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:24.350
Rio and I won't lose.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.100
We're the ones who are going to win.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:28.350
Be prepared, Mana Nagase.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:31.520
We'll make you taste your first failure.

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:34.980
Then, shall we?

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.900
Now, let's show them who we are.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:07.270
♬ There's no time to waver ♬

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:09.520
♬ When I discovered my weak self ♬

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:12.100
♬ It's all determined by where I go ♬

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:13.650
♬ Purity of desire ♬

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:14.810
♬ Raise it higher and higher ♬

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.980
♬ Choose and fight ♬

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:19.440
♬ You want to express that passion, right? ♬

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:21.980
♬ There were feelings you held inside ♬

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:23.480
♬ It still hurts ♬

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.940
♬ My heart still hurts ♬

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.400
♬ I'll get the star for me ♬

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.520
♬ Rather than having a dream ♬

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.900
♬ You'll get the star for you ♬

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:29.940
♬ I'll become the dream ♬

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.560
♬ We'll get the star for dream ♬

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:34.310
♬ Dancing, yes, is testimony of life ♬

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.520
♬ So there's no such thing as
a certain tomorrow ♬

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:40.350
♬ That is the meaning of challenge ♬

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.600
♬ I know I know I'm feeling it ♬

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:45.060
♬ GIRI-GIRI borderless world! ♬

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:50.060
♬ Everyone will eventually settle it somehow ♬

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.850
♬ If there are lies in your heart ♬

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:55.270
♬ You'll most likely fall down ♬

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.850
♬ Judge now
It's time to ask yourself ♬

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:01.440
♬ Fulfill your true wish ♬

00:18:25.850 --> 00:18:27.690
Now, let's sing!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.350
From here to the future!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.940
From here to space!

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.310
Let's aim for the top!

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.480
With the light of the moon in our hands!

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.770
Moon Tempest!

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:48.270
♬ You were always there, closest to me ♬

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:52.730
♬ The reason for your unwavering smile ♬

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:55.770
♬ The light of the moon! ♬

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:12.650
♬ Don't apologize anymore ♬

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.350
♬ It's not anyone's fault ♬

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:18.440
♬ Even those conflicting words ♬

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.940
♬ It's all right ♬

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:24.770
♬ Gentleness and compassion will someday ♬

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:30.770
♬ Reach the precious heart ♬

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:35.900
♬ The only moon of this Earth ♬

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:38.850
♬ Just like that forever ♬

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:43.940
♬ Let's shine together! ♬

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:46.730
♬ We'll go beyond the skies ♬

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.440
♬ We'll go beyond the atmosphere ♬

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:52.020
♬ We'll aim for a future
we've never seen before ♬

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:54.850
♬ The one and only light ♬

00:19:54.850 --> 00:20:00.270
♬ Because you're there I can be myself ♬

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:05.400
♬ Search for the place that's your own
without copying anyone else ♬

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:10.980
♬ I want to give you joy and keep smiling ♬

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:15.190
♬ The reason for my unwavering singing ♬

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.440
♬ The light of the moon ♬

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:35.900
Now, who will move forward to the finals?

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:39.230
Will it be LizNoir, who made it
to the finals last time?

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.770
Or the freshly debuted new face,
Moon Tempest?!

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:46.690
And now, the fated results are in!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:56.230
The finalist is...

00:20:57.850 --> 00:21:01.100
Moon Tempest!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:05.270
We did it, Suzu- <i>nyan</i> !

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.480
I had a lot of fun.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:15.270
Me, too.

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:18.690
So the finals is a battle between
Hoshimi Productions idols.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:22.400
Didn't expect you all to grow this much.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:24.650
Miss Rio, Miss Aoi...

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.770
Make it the best finals ever.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.270
Yes!

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:46.730
Miss Rio!

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:52.440
I heard my sister considered you her rival.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.940
There's no way.

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:58.310
She pretended to act indifferent
because she felt that you were her rival.

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.690
She's just like you, Rio.

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:04.650
If that's the case...

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:09.400
...I need to work hard
and become a true idol.

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:12.270
So I don't disappoint her.

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:36.150
Mana...

00:23:36.150 --> 00:23:37.980
I'm okay.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:40.230
I won't disappear yet.

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:44.850
Not until I see everyone
stand on the finals stage!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:47.030
Burn the Sound of Life
